    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Project Insights'>
      <style />
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='88237' id='3' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='99166' x='417' y='10957'>
            <zone fixed-size='664' forceUpdate='true' h='67674' id='6' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='99166' x='417' y='10957'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontsize='15'>1- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>Higher stress levels consistently lead to significantly increased employee burnout.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>2-Employees with lower sleep duration report higher emotional exhaustion and workplace stress.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>3-High burnout groups demonstrate stronger job change intention, increasing attrition risk.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>4-Work-life balance remains one of the strongest predictors of employee wellbeing.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>5-Employees receiving strong managerial support show noticeably lower burnout levels. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>6-AI adoption is reshaping employee productivity, workload patterns, and workplace wellbeing. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>7-AI users display measurable differences in stress, satisfaction, and work intensity metrics.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>8-Extended weekly work hours contribute to emotional fatigue and reduced work-life balance. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>9-Burnout levels vary significantly across job roles and organizational responsibilities. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>10-Remote and hybrid employees generally experience healthier work-life balance outcomes. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>11-Employees with low autonomy scores report higher stress and lower job satisfaction. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>12-Deadline pressure strongly correlates with increased stress and burnout scores. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>13-Employees with healthier lifestyle habits demonstrate lower mental health risk indicators. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>14-Anxiety and depression indicators reveal growing workplace mental health concerns across modern organizations. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>15-Teams with poor social support structures exhibit elevated burnout and stress patterns. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>16-High burnout employees are more likely to seek mental health support services. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>17-Burnout appears to be driven by multiple interconnected workplace and lifestyle factors rather than a single cause. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>18-Organizations prioritizing employee wellbeing may reduce attrition and improve workforce stability. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>19-Workforce mental health analytics can help organizations identify high-risk employee groups proactively. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3b348' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='15'>20-Preventive mental health initiatives and balanced workloads are critical for sustainable productivity in AI-driven workplaces.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
